OL,3,GNEWSAEx-champion teaches people with
OL,4,AParkinson's to box
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former world boxing champion is
OL,7,Fteaching people with Parkinson's his
OL,8,Fcraft "to give back" to the community.
OL,10,FIn the UK, the current total number of
OL,11,Fpeople diagnosed with Parkinson's is
OL,12,Fabout 166,000. It is a progressive
OL,13,Fneurological condition that can affect
OL,14,Fa person's mobility, speech, focus,
OL,15,Fsleep and independence.
OL,17,FFormer IBO welterweight champion Jawaid
OL,18,FKhaliq, 56, from The Meadows in
OL,19,FNottingham, began running the
OL,20,Fno-contact boxing classes in March.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
